@baseUrl        = http://localhost:3000
@recruiterToken = PASTE_TOKEN_RECRUITER_DISINI

# Catatan: Recruiter harus sudah di-assign ke perusahaan oleh admin
# (POST /api/companies/:id/assign-recruiter)


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  DASHBOARD
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Dashboard Recruiter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  LOWONGAN KERJA
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Lihat Semua Lowongan (publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs

### Filter Lowongan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs?keyword=developer&location=Jakarta&job_type=full-time

### Detail Lowongan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/1

### Buat Lowongan (otomatis ke perusahaan recruiter)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category_id": 1,
  "title": "Frontend Developer",
  "description": "Membangun tampilan web menggunakan React.js",
  "location": "Remote",
  "job_type": "contract",
  "education_required": "D3",
  "experience_min_years": 1,
  "salary_min": 5000000,
  "salary_max": 10000000,
  "required_skills": ["react", "javascript", "html", "css"],
  "deadline": "2026-07-31"
}

### Update Lowongan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior Frontend Developer",
  "description": "Membangun tampilan web enterprise",
  "location": "Jakarta",
  "experience_min_years": 2,
  "salary_min": 8000000,
  "salary_max": 15000000,
  "status": "open"
}

### Tutup Lowongan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "closed"
}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  LAMARAN KERJA
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Lihat Semua Lamaran (di perusahaan recruiter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

### Lihat Pelamar per Job
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/job/1
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

### Detail Lamaran
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

### Update Status → Reviewed
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Reviewed"
}

### Update Status → Interview
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Interview"
}

### Update Status → Accepted
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Accepted"
}

### Update Status → Rejected
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Rejected"
}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  SHORTLIST KANDIDAT
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Tambah ke Shortlist
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shortlists
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "application_id": 1,
  "notes": "Kandidat potensial, skill cocok dengan requirement"
}

### Lihat Shortlist Saya
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shortlists
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

### Hapus dari Shortlist
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/shortlists/1
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  JADWAL INTERVIEW
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Jadwalkan Interview
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interviews/applications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduledAt": "2026-07-15 10:00:00",
  "meetingLink": "https://meet.google.com/abc-defg-hij",
  "location": "Online via Google Meet",
  "notes": "Interview teknis 60 menit — siapkan contoh project"
}

### Lihat Interview per Lamaran
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/interviews/applications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

### Lihat Semua Interview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/interviews
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}

### Update Interview (reschedule)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/interviews/1
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduledAt": "2026-07-16 14:00:00",
  "meetingLink": "https://zoom.us/j/123456789",
  "location": "Zoom",
  "notes": "Reschedule — interview HR + teknis gabungan"
}

### Hapus Interview
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/interviews/1
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  MATCHING KANDIDAT
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Match Kandidat untuk Job
### Response: skor 0–100 (Skills 50 + Edu 20 + Exp 20 + Lokasi 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/matching/job/1
Authorization: Bearer {{recruiterToken}}
